{'symbol': 'LEN', 'date': '2022-04-20 12:04:00', 'title': 'LMC ANNOUNCES OPENING OF THE REMY', 'text': 'MID-RISE LUXURY COMMUNITY IN THE HEART OF PLANTATION\xa0 PLANTATION, FLA. , APRIL 20, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LMC , A WHOLLY OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF LENNAR CORPORATION [NYSE: LEN] AND A LEADER IN APARTMENT DEVELOPMENT AND MANAGEMENT, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE OPENING OF THE REMY , A LUXURY APARTMENT COMMUNITY IN PLANTATION, LOCATED JUST WEST OF FT.'}